        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Flores Borrego, Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez\n- Organizations: Gulf Cartel, Metros, Rojos\n- Events: Infighting in the Gulf Cartel, death of Samuel Flores Borrego\n\nFacts:\n- Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez was born on 1 August 1971.\n- Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez was a former Mexican drug lord and a top leader of the Gulf Cartel.\n- Upon his arrest, Samuel Flores Borrego became the right-hand man of Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez.\n- Samuel Flores Borrego died in September 2011.\n- Directly after the death of Samuel Flores Borrego in September 2011, the Gulf Cartel experienced a series of confrontations known as the infighting in the Gulf Cartel.\n- The infighting in the Gulf Cartel was a power struggle between the Metros and the Rojos, two factions within the Gulf Cartel.",
